 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"d662966f-5ee0-45f8-9380-0d6cadbe0943"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["In this study, we explore the behavior of a damped \
spring-mass system through a two-part approach. Initially, we determine the \
general solution by solving the equations of motion and visualizing it \
graphically. Subsequently, we address an intriguing inverse problem by \
fitting experimental data to the theoretical model, thereby characterizing \
damping and angular frequency. By reconciling theory with observation, we are \
able to better understand the system properties based on our experimental \
findings.",
 FontSize->16]], "Abstract",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9292736081805925`*^9, 3.9292736425573854`*^9, {3.9292764523823123`*^9, 
   3.9292765281445866`*^9}, {3.929276709117582*^9, 
   3.929276728421426*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1efd21a6-a447-4cc4-842b-\
433e14662747"],

